{"unit_id":"oxmumu3__dsh-project-companion#card-card-zh","repo":"oxmumu3/dsh-project-companion","commit":"26a8faa4408a094d9903b3b02429d9ba51e39c3b","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Dot** 是 DeepSeek Harness 的项目助理，可在网页或桌面工作台使用，也可连接微信。它接入项目对话与工具，记录已关注项目的目标、决策和下一步，支持查看进展、明确交办和设置提醒；还可按需汇总个人资料并生成资讯日报。适合需要跨会话推进项目的用户，Google、flomo、滴答等资料连接按需配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1053-1361","src/client.js:1404-1416"]}
{"unit_id":"oxmumu3__dsh-project-companion#card-card-en","repo":"oxmumu3/dsh-project-companion","commit":"26a8faa4408a094d9903b3b02429d9ba51e39c3b","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**DSH Dot** is a project assistant for DeepSeek Harness with a workbench and optional WeChat entry. It keeps goals and decisions for watched projects, shows progress, hands off explicit tasks, and schedules reminders. Optional connected sources can support personal reviews and an AI news digest.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1053-1361","src/client.js:1404-1416"]}
